<div data-type="problem" id="fs-id1167794062777"><div class="os-problem-container">
<p id="fs-id1167793896415">What is <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mi>γ</mi></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> if <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.650</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>?</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.650</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>?</mo></mrow></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span></p>
